06. POST temporal query with a member a Query does not have - 400: its body is checked as a Query
=================================================================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 193

{
  "detail": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/default-context/notAMember",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid field for query",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



--TEARDOWN--
coraineStop
